	<!-- War Caster -->
	<content contentuid="h1d3dddd2gd694g4784g9837g00044b92e108" version="1">War Caster</content>
	<content contentuid="hf337ae58g3615g4b5dg891dge1c6f572f938" version="1">Your &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Intelligence"&gt;Intelligence&lt;/LSTag&gt;, &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Wisdom"&gt;Wisdom&lt;/LSTag&gt; or &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Charisma"&gt;Charisma&lt;/LSTag&gt; increases by 1.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;Advantage&lt;/LSTag&gt; on &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throws&lt;/LSTag&gt; to maintain &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Concentration"&gt;Concentration&lt;/LSTag&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also use a &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;Reaction&lt;/LSTag&gt; to cast a spell when a hostile creature's movement provokes an &lt;LSTag Tooltip="OpportunityAttack"&gt;Opportunity Attack&lt;/LSTag&gt; from you.</content>

